      "sections": [
        {
          "number": "Story",
          "heading": "Read the complete context before answering",
          "text": "Four years ago, we decided to go away for the weekend. We wanted to go to Portugal, so we booked a beautiful apartment online. A week later, we took a taxi to the airport. We arrived at the airport at two o’clock, and we asked to check in. The woman at the desk asked us for our passports. We looked in our bags and coat pockets, but we couldn’t find them. So we went home again!"
        }
